  "sync-client": {
    "name": "Sync Client",
    "description": "The D-13 client side: a local mirror of the host `sync` plugin's store, plus a periodic heartbeat. On every (re)connect it subscribes to the host's delta events, pulls a `sync_get_snapshot` to seed the mirror, then applies deltas as they arrive. The heartbeat pushes this device's liveness into the host's sync state via `sync_set`, and reconnect re-pulls the snapshot so an offline device catches up.",
